Don't want to be overly verbose here, so summarising the problems and action items;
- Fork choice is all-important. FOCIL, is needed, ideally with a 100x+ step up in CR rather than 16x based on the chain's current level of centralisation and trajectory. 
- If you make less money delegating to a small pool of stake, less people will do it. We need to flatten expected return if we want to stop centralisation continuing.

